<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<div class="row justify-content-center">
  <div class="col-lg-8">
    <h1 class="h3">About DevStory</h1>
    <p>
      DevStory started in 2017 as a final-year project: a platform intended to be the meeting point for
      developers, mostly from Nepal, to discuss, share ideas and collaborate.
    </p>
    <p>Its features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>a blog with tags, votes and comments;</li>
      <li>a question &amp; answer forum;</li>
      <li>following other developers and an activity feed;</li>
      <li>private one-to-one messaging;</li>
      <li>“similar posts” recommendations based on TF-IDF and cosine similarity.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
